3	// Native coordinator for Agent tool execution. Any Agent — the deterministic
4	// mock today, an MCP adapter later — proposes typed tool requests here; the
5	// coordinator applies the approval policy, holds the authoritative activity
6	// records, and executes approved actions exclusively through the IWorkspace
7	// contract, so Orca's own commands, history, and events stay in charge.
8	// GUI-free and deterministic: execution advances only when the owner calls
9	// pump(), so tests can drive it without timers.
10	
